## **6. Common Pitfalls to Avoid**

| Problem | Solution |
|---|---|
| **Guessing column names** | Always run `get_table_metadata()` first |
| **Unexpected duplicates** | Check for multiple rows per category (like 90.1-2010 Tables A & B) |
| **NULL values breaking queries** | Use `IS NOT NULL` or `COUNT()` to verify |
| **Capacity range confusion** | Use `<=` and `>=` for overlapping ranges, not exact matches |
| **Wrong table selected** | Use `get_candidate_tables()` with proper descriptors |
| **Date filtering issues** | Check date format (text vs. actual dates) |

