## **8. Useful SQL Patterns for This Database**

```sql
-- Compare across versions
SELECT template, equipment_type, efficiency
FROM table
WHERE equipment_type IN ('Type A', 'Type B')
ORDER BY template, equipment_type;

-- Find evolution over time
SELECT template, AVG(efficiency) as avg_efficiency
FROM table
GROUP BY template
ORDER BY CAST(SUBSTR(template, 6, 4) AS INTEGER);

-- Calculate differences
SELECT 
  template,
  MAX(efficiency) - MIN(efficiency) as efficiency_range
FROM table
GROUP BY template;

-- Handle overlapping ranges
SELECT * FROM table
WHERE minimum_capacity <= 40
  AND maximum_capacity >= 30;
```

