rifugal,,9/9/1919,9/9/2999,20.0,,From IECC-2012 Table C403.2.3(8)\\n30,IECC-2018,Open Cooling Tower,Propeller or Axial,,9/9/1919,9/9/2999,40.2,,From IECC-2018 Table C403.2.3(8)\', \'id\': \'lc_007e6c9d-7c3f-4135-9435-338c2e48b57d\'}]\n\n'}
