*High Limit Shutoff Parameters by Control Strategy**\n\n| Control Strategy | 90.1-2004 | 90.1-2010 | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Fixed Dry Bulb** | 65-75°F (zone-dependent) | 70-75°F (zone-dependent) | Restricted in humid zones; 7A raised 5°F |\n| **Fixed Enthalpy** | 28 Btu/lb (where allowed) | 28 Btu/lb (where allowed) | **No change** |\n| **Dew Point/Dry Bulb** | 55°F DP / 75°F DB | 55°F DP / 75°F DB | **No change** |\n\n---\n\n### **Climate Zone Breakdown: Fixed Dry Bulb Thresholds**\n\n| Climate Zone | 90.1-2004 | 90.1-2010 | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **0A (Hot-Humid)** | 65°F | ❌ Not Allowed | **Removed** |\n| **0B (Hot-Dry)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **1A (Hot-Humid)** | 65°F | ❌ Not Allowed | **Removed** |\n| **1B (Hot-Dry)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **2A (Warm-Humid)** | 65°F | ❌ Not Allowed | **Removed** |\n| **2B (Warm-Dry)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **3A (Warm-Humid)** | 65°F | ❌ Not Allowed | **Removed** |\n| **3B (Warm-Dry)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **3C (Warm-Coastal)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **4A (Mixed-Humid)** | 65°F | ❌ Not Allowed | **Removed** |\n| **4B (Mixed-Dry)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **4C (Mixed-Coastal)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **5A (Cool-Humid)** | 70°F | 70°F | Unchanged |\n| **5B (Cool-Dry)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **5C (Cool-Coastal)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **6A (Cold-Humid)** | 70°F | 70°F | Unchanged |\n| **6B (Cold-Dry)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **7 (Very Cold)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **7A (Very Cold-Humid)** | 70°F | 75°F | **Raised 5°F** |\n| **7B (Very Cold-Dry)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n| **8 (Subarctic)** | 75°F | 75°F | Unchanged |\n\n---\n\n### **Fixed Enthalpy Availability**\n\n**90.1-2004**: Allowed in humid zones (0A, 1A, 2A, 3A, 4A, 5A, 6A)\n- High limit shutoff: **28 Btu/lb**\n\n**90.1-2010**: Expanded availability\n- **Newly allowed** in Zones 2A, 3A, 4A (previously only dry bulb)\n- **Retained** in Zones 0A, 1A, 5A, 6A\n- 